# CODEOWNERS — enforces review ownership.
# Break-glass (D. Operación): changes to security-critical paths require review
# from TWO code owners (configure "Require review from Code Owners" + a branch
# protection rule of 2 approvals on main). The break-glass workflow additionally
# opens a CRITICAL audit issue on every emergency override.

# Security-critical paths — 2 owners required
/.github/workflows/      @fleetsec/secops @fleetsec/platform-leads
/terraform/              @fleetsec/secops @fleetsec/cloud-platform
/semgrep/                @fleetsec/secops
/detection/              @fleetsec/secops
/.gitleaks.toml          @fleetsec/secops
/CODEOWNERS              @fleetsec/secops @fleetsec/platform-leads

# Application code
/app/                    @fleetsec/app-team @fleetsec/secops
